 "remarks": "Incredible opportunity on the DARIEN BORDER! Dive right into this modernized & immaculate TOP FLOOR 2BR, 2FBA condo w/CARPORT, 2nd RESERVED parking space, vaulted ceilings, wood-burning fireplace & brand NEW major structural components (roof, siding, windows, sliders, skylights, deck plus hot water heater, A/C unit & more) w/the best positioning! Expansive, open & airy living room/dining area w/soaring ceilings, skylights, ceiling fan & dbl-sliders out to private deck w/peaceful treed view - enjoy fresh air all times of year! Gorgeous, thoughtfully upgraded kitchen w/sparkling s/s appliances (water dispenser & ice maker), beautiful granite countertops (under-mount sink w/disposal), plenty of cabinet storage, eat-in nook & convenient pass-thru - entertain w/ease! Spacious PBR also has tree-top views from large picture window - a perfect serene escape - w/very deep, dbl-closet (built-ins) & refreshed FBA. Well-sized 2nd BR & refreshed 2nd FBA, too. Flawlessly maintained throughout, W/D w/storage above, sep linen closet, dbl-coat closet, bonus storage, keyless entry & digital thermostats (zoned heat & A/C) make it complete. Think summer days spent by the POOL just a few steps from your door & shops, restaurants, fitness, Darien's Retail Corridor & South Norwalk's entertainment district plus conveniences (Trader Joe's/Wegmans/Whole Foods/Costco & more!) only a hop-skip away, daily life is a breeze! Less than 1mi to I-95 & less than 2mi to Darien or Rowayton RR. Welcome to CT!",
